{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42300","headline":"陪郑王相公赋筵前垂冰应教依韵 · 徐铉","name":"陪郑王相公赋筵前垂冰应教依韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗外虚明雪乍晴，檐前垂溜尽成冰。\n长廊瓦叠行行密，晚院风高寸寸增。\n玉指乍拈簪尚媿，金阶时坠磬难胜。\n晨餐堪醒曹参酒，自恨空肠病不能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}